{"root":{"data":{"id":"difo0sowp6o0","created":1778484170314,"text":"影像接收器"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difo2gi5zkw0","created":1778484300513,"text":"胶片"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difo95fmtew0","created":1778484824965,"text":"构成"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"difo979v9j40","created":1778484828970,"text":"原理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"difo9ihh8tk0","created":1778484853374,"text":"分类"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"difo2hgo2fs0","created":1778484302599,"text":"影像记录板(IP)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difo9ihh8tk0","created":1778484853374,"text":"分类"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difoo7yb2iw0","created":1778486005910,"text":"高分辨率型HR/普通型ST"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"difoogolli80","created":1778486024914,"text":"硬基板/软基板/透明基板"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"difooszem000","created":1778486051689,"text":"单面/双面阅读"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"difo95fmtew0","created":1778484824965,"text":"构成"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difoq1pnxyg0","created":1778486149055,"text":"外型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difoqnfyqso0","created":1778486196358,"text":"暗盒前/后板"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"difoq5b6kls0","created":1778486156886,"text":"内部"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difoq6y202o0","created":1778486160446,"text":"保护层"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"difou3ymnk80","created":1778486467407,"text":"防散射层"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"difoq8fcyv40","created":1778486163669,"text":"荧光层"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difor07w2f40","created":1778486224167,"text":"光激发物质PSS/光激发发光PSL"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"difos86dtdc0","created":1778486319855,"text":"含有微量二甲郁离子的氟卤化钡晶体"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"difotjzzhkg0","created":1778486423953,"text":"结晶体尺寸约为4~7微米"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"difoucpg03c0","created":1778486486443,"text":"X线吸收层"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"difoqb7hbsw0","created":1778486169723,"text":"支持层","note":"(为防止反射设置为黑色)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"difoqdtxafc0","created":1778486175434,"text":"背面保护层"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"difo979v9j40","created":1778484828970,"text":"原理","note":"设备学P106\n荧光物质将(第一次照射)X线照射时的信息记录下来,后受(第二次照射)激光的照射,激励出含有<第一次照射接受到信息>的荧光"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"difo2jkxtjk0","created":1778484307211,"text":"平板探测器(FPD)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difo9ihh8tk0","created":1778484853374,"text":"分类"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difobw3m4y00","created":1778485039739,"text":"非晶硅平板探测器","expandState":"expand","note":"间接转换\n#### X线转换介质\n碘化铯晶体\n硫氧化钆\n\n\n\n#### 构成\n1. 保护层\n  * 铝板/碳板\n2. 反射层\n  * 全反射\n3. 闪烁晶体层\n  * 吸收X线并将X线能量转化为荧光\n4. 探测元阵列层\n  * 将荧光转换为电信号\n5. 处理电路层\n  * 放大器,多路A/D转换器,控制电路\n6. 支撑层\n  * 玻璃基板"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difo979v9j40","created":1778484828970,"text":"原理"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"difoc884vlk0","created":1778485066134,"text":"非晶硒平板探测器","note":"直接转换\n无X线转换介质\n\n#### 构成\n1. 导电层\n2. 电介层\n3. 非晶硒层\n4. 集电器\n5. 薄膜晶体管(内有储能电容)\n6. 玻璃衬底"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difo979v9j40","created":1778484828970,"text":"原理"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"difochafy080","created":1778485085865,"text":"CCD型探测器","note":"1. 荧光层\n2. 光学系统层\n3. CCD层\n4. 计算机控制及处理系统\n\n间接转换探测器的一种"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difo979v9j40","created":1778484828970,"text":"原理"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"difqgaxisug0","created":1778491027699,"text":"组成"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difqgdid46g0","created":1778491033313,"text":"X线接收器,命令处理器,外接电源"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}